// Windows resource script — compiled by build.rs, linked into the .exe.
//
// The shell takes the first RT_GROUP_ICON in the resource table as the
// application icon, so one statement is all it needs. "icon.ico" is found
// through the include path build.rs passes (/I assets), which also keeps this
// file usable by hand from the assets directory.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
